      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "This is a dataset with multiparametric MRI protocol applied in a test-retest setting, allowing to evaluate repeatability of the MRI-based measurements in the prostate. There is very limited data about the repeatability in mpMRI of the prostate, while such information is critical for imaging biomarker development. Data was provided by Brigham and Women's Hospital, PI Dr. Fiona Fennessy.Type of cancer: Confirmed or suspected prostate cancer",
          "descriptionType": "Abstract",
          "lang": null
        }
